<title>USA: Vans Inc names Gary Schoenfeld CEO.</title>
<headline>Vans Inc names Gary Schoenfeld CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vans Inc Tuesday said Gary Schoenfeld, the company's president and chief operating officer, will assume the additional responsibility of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, Vans said Gary Schoenfeld succeeds his father Walter Schoenfeld, 66, who continues as chairman.</p>
